   "text": "Task\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n- id, name, sequenceNumber\n- job: Runnable\n- schedule: Schedule\n~ volatile status, nextExecTime\n~ volatile runCount, last*Time\n+ recordExecution(sched, done)\n+ getNextExecutionTime()",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "task",
   "originalText": "Task\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n- id, name, sequenceNumber\n- job: Runnable\n- schedule: Schedule\n~ volatile status, nextExecTime\n~ volatile runCount, last*Time\n+ recordExecution(sched, done)\n+ getNextExecutionTime()",
